import{_ as t,o,c as i,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 276 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Analysis of Aristocratic Remnants: The Monopoly Was Not Thoroughly Broken","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 276 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Analysis of Aristocratic Remnants: The Monopoly Was Not Thoroughly Broken","no":276,"module":2,"tags":["Tang-Luo","Aristocratic Remnants","Incomplete Monopoly Break","Reskinned Monopoly","Myriad-Realms Benchmark"],"related":["47-Anti-Monopoly Law","04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis","36-Social Structure and Class Mobility"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0276_模块2-唐罗-世家残余分析.md","filePath":"en/0276_模块2-唐罗-世家残余分析.md"}'),a={name:"en/0276_模块2-唐罗-世家残余分析.md"};function s(r,e,l,d,c,h){return o(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-276-tang-luo-decomposition-analysis-of-aristocratic-remnants-the-monopoly-was-not-thoroughly-broken" tabindex="-1">Entry 276 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Analysis of Aristocratic Remnants: The Monopoly Was Not Thoroughly Broken <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-276-tang-luo-decomposition-analysis-of-aristocratic-remnants-the-monopoly-was-not-thoroughly-broken" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 276 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Analysis of Aristocratic Remnants: The Monopoly Was Not Thoroughly Broken&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Tang-Luo System (Entry 26)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-overthrew-the-aristocrats-left-the-aristocrats-shadow" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Overthrew the aristocrats, left the aristocrats&#39; shadow <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-overthrew-the-aristocrats-left-the-aristocrats-shadow" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Overthrew the aristocrats, left the aristocrats&#39; shadow&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the anti-predation axiom requires Great Dao all-tier openness, anti-monopoly constitutionalized. Tang Luo overthrew old aristocratic families, but the old families&#39; remnants — wealth, connections, knowledge, habits — were not liquidated. This entry takes the law-first axiom as core, dissecting how aristocratic remnants reskin and return. Protagonist uniqueness dependency judgment: <strong>Tang Luo = high dependency / bestowal-style civilization</strong>. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Aristocratic remnants&#39; energy-level waste:</p><ul><li><strong>Old capital not liquidated</strong>: wealth, industries, connections accumulated by old families, Tang Luo did not touch. They change names, still are social top</li><li><strong>Old knowledge not forcibly opened</strong>: families&#39; inherited methods, Tang Luo only &quot;no longer forbids private transmission,&quot; did not force upload. They still privately hoard, only from &quot;legal monopoly&quot; to &quot;gray monopoly&quot;</li><li><strong>Old habits continue</strong>: family children receive elite education from childhood, commoners&#39; children start from zero. Ten years later, family children still occupy academy high tiers</li></ul><p>Energy-level waste: <strong>overthrew the family signboard, left the family&#39;s foundation.</strong> Signboard changed, inside is still old people.</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Reskinned return</strong>: old families rename as &quot;Tang Luo direct disciples,&quot; &quot;academy high tier,&quot; &quot;chamber-of-commerce leaders.&quot; Monopoly form changed, monopoly essence unchanged</li><li><strong>New-old merge</strong>: the few rising commoner geniuses decades later intermarry, ally with old family remnants, forming new mixed powerholding class</li><li><strong>Institutional absence</strong>: because no anti-monopoly constitution, the new powerholding class can legally accumulate wealth, knowledge, connections, until monopoly forms again</li></ol><p>Regression form: Tang Luo overthrew old aristocrats, but new aristocrats began growing under his rule. After he dies, new aristocrats become open.</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Compromise is predation</strong>: Tang Luo took &quot;overthrow but not liquidate&quot; compromise toward old families. The compromise price is — old family remnants retained most strength, waiting to counterattack</li><li><strong>Reskinning is predation</strong>: new powerholders self-claim &quot;beneficiaries of Tang Luo good policy,&quot; monopoly no longer called &quot;aristocratic family,&quot; called &quot;elite.&quot; Name changed, predation structure unchanged</li><li><strong>No legislation is predation</strong>: because no anti-monopoly law, new powerholders&#39; accumulation is legal. Legal predation is harder to break than illegal predation</li></ul><p>By the Gu Chensha / Tang Luo judgment table standard: Tang Luo = <strong>enlightened predator</strong>, his compromise toward old families is essentially reaching an unspoken agreement with old predators: &quot;I won&#39;t exterminate you, you change names and continue.&quot;</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Tang-Luo Overthrows Families</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis Anti-Monopoly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Overthrow signboard</td><td>Anti-Monopoly Law constitutionalized, any form of knowledge monopoly illegal</td></tr><tr><td>Retain foundation</td><td>Old family assets forcibly audited, excess redistributed by contribution</td></tr><tr><td>Inherited methods gray-retained</td><td>All inherited methods forcibly uploaded to Alaya, private hoarding illegal</td></tr><tr><td>New powerholders legally accumulate</td><td>Anchor Supervision Committee monitors wealth concentration, over-limit = correction</td></tr><tr><td>Reskinned return</td><td>Rigid clause: any &quot;direct disciple,&quot; &quot;elite&quot; privilege unconstitutional</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Alternative&#39;s crux: Tang Luo overthrew old families&#39; bodies; what Heng Yuan Zhou wants to eliminate is the structure of &quot;aristocratic family&quot; itself.</p><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate Tang-Luo &quot;overthrow but not liquidate&quot; model</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: Group A maintains; Group B injects Anti-Monopoly Law + forced liquidation</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: new powerholder proportion within a hundred years, wealth Gini coefficient</li><li><strong>Review expectation</strong>: Group A Gini returns to pre-reform within a hundred years, Group B keeps declining</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-high</strong>. Overthrowing aristocrats is a classic web-novel trope</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: medium</strong>. Long-form late if it needs &quot;villains,&quot; the cheapest move is letting some &quot;aristocratic remnant&quot; jump out — the early &quot;families destroyed&quot; setting is torn by plot</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</strong>: high</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: old foundation not liquidated, monopoly remnants keep consuming civilization</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: compromise is predation, reskinning is predation</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo overthrew signboards, did not eliminate structures</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: anti-monopoly is the institutional guarantee that 99% is not preyed upon by 9%</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: cross-plane civilization must root out anti-monopoly</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="supplementary-discussion-network-cleansing-of-monopoly-remnants" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Discussion: Network Cleansing of Monopoly Remnants <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-discussion-network-cleansing-of-monopoly-remnants" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Discussion: Network Cleansing of Monopoly Remnants&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Tang-Luo system breaking family monopoly incompletely stems from power transition still circulating within families. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s alternative is Alaya Network&#39;s transparency institution: all law-anchored authority, resource distribution records are auditable on the network. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s Myriad Races Republican Council does not set hereditary seats; the law-first axiom ensures institutional design eliminates familization. The universal equal infinite law negates at the rights level the old narrative that &quot;family descendants are born stronger&quot;; monopoly remnants are simultaneously cleansed at both institutional and conceptual levels.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Overthrowing aristocratic families is easy, eliminating the &quot;aristocratic family&quot; structure is hard. Tang Luo did the former, not the latter. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s judgment: without liquidating old foundations, without an anti-monopoly law, overthrown aristocrats will grow back in fifty years — different names, same bones.</p><p>In the final analysis, Tang-Luo · analysis of aristocratic remnants described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./47-反垄断法.html">47-Anti-Monopoly Law</a> · <a href="./04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis</a> · <a href="./36-社会结构与阶层流动.html">36-Social Structure and Class Mobility</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',31)])])}const g=t(a,[["render",s]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
